  "story": {
    "title": "Rainbow Boys",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "“Arrey! Are you crying? A boy crying!” “What are you wearing?”",
      "“Are you playing with a doll?” “Why do you have long hair?”",
      "Who says all boys should be the same? They are not photocopies of one another. They are individuals.",
      "He is tall. He is slightly fat. He is short. He is neither tall nor short. He is thin. He is neither fat nor thin.",
      "He lost his leg in an accident. That hasn’t stopped him. He goes everywhere. He is sightless since childhood. He can do everything.",
      "Some boys like to shout and bully their friends. Some are gentle. They don’t pick fights and lend a helping hand to all.",
      "Some love to sew and knit and are very good at it.",
      "Some love to study and have no interest in games. Some love to play and if they had their way, they would play the whole day.",
      "He loves colourful, frilly clothes. Sometimes he wears Didi’s dresses. Ma says no, but he says, “Ma, if Didi can wear it, why can’t I?”",
      "He loves trees. He has planted many trees and takes care of them.",
      "All children should be what they want to be Because they are all individuals"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "“Arrey! Are you crying?",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Này! Con đang khóc à?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "A boy crying!” “What are you wearing?”",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con trai mà khóc à! Con đang mặc gì thế?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Are you playing with a doll?” “Why do you have long hair?”",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con đang chơi búp bê à? Sao con lại để tóc dài thế?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Who says all boys should be the same?",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ai nói tất cả các bạn trai phải giống nhau?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They are not photocopies of one another.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn ấy không phải là bản sao của nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They are individuals.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mỗi bạn là một người riêng biệt."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He is tall.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy cao."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He is slightly fat.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy hơi mập một chút."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He is short.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy thấp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He is neither tall nor short.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy không cao cũng không thấp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He is thin.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy gầy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He is neither fat nor thin.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy không mập cũng không gầy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He lost his leg in an accident.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy bị mất một chân trong một tai nạn."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "That hasn’t stopped him.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Điều đó không ngăn cản được bạn ấy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He goes everywhere.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy đi khắp mọi nơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He is sightless since childhood.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy bị mù từ nhỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He can do everything.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy có thể làm mọi thứ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some boys like to shout and bully their friends.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một số bạn trai thích la hét và bắt nạt bạn bè."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some are gentle.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một số bạn thì hiền lành."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They don’t pick fights and lend a helping hand to all.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn ấy không gây gổ và luôn giúp đỡ mọi người."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some love to sew and knit and are very good at it.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một số bạn thích may vá, đan lát và làm rất giỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some love to study and have no interest in games.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một số bạn thích học và không thích chơi game."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Some love to play and if they had their way, they would play the whole day.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một số bạn thích chơi và nếu được, các bạn ấy sẽ chơi cả ngày."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He loves colourful, frilly clothes.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy thích quần áo sặc sỡ, có bèo nhún."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sometimes he wears Didi’s dresses.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đôi khi bạn ấy mặc váy của chị Didi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Ma says no, but he says, “Ma, if Didi can wear it, why can’t I?”",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ nói không được, nhưng bạn ấy nói: \"Mẹ ơi, nếu chị Didi mặc được thì sao con lại không được?\""
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He loves trees.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy yêu cây cối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He has planted many trees and takes care of them.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bạn ấy đã trồng nhiều cây và chăm sóc chúng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "All children should be what they want to be Because they are all individuals",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_111756/s_028.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Tất cả trẻ em nên được là chính mình, bởi vì mỗi bạn là một cá nhân riêng biệt."
      }
    ]
